Display-rate matching (app/src/main/java/com/ritim/ritimcraw/engine/DisplayRate.kt): written
for this project from the arithmetic of refresh intervals (whole multiples, otherwise least
RMS hold-time deviation), with its own structure and names. The owner's other app, Klipp,
solves the same problem, but Klipp is GPL-3.0-only and this project is Apache-2.0, so no
Klipp code was copied. The Android side (Surface.setFrameRate on API 30+, the window mode as
the fallback) is also new in this project.

